    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Rathfarnham are delighted to present 600 Woodview Cottages to the market. This beautiful cut-stone cottage which dates back to the early 1900's comes to market in great condition ready for new owners. Woodview Cottages comprises two terraces of attractive period cottages with small gardens to the front and convenient rear yards with vehicular access to the rear. \n\nThe cottages are positioned behind Rathfarnham Village and opposite Bushy Park in a quiet cul-de-sac location with on-street parking for all. An appealing location set right beside a large public green space the homes at Woodview Cottages exude charm that is all too often absent from more modern homes. \n\nNumber 600, positioned close to the quieter end of the terrace features generous accommodation of approximately 80 square metres including a welcoming entrance hall, front reception room which doubles as a third bedroom, living room to the rear and an extended kitchen/breakfast room at the back with direct access to the rear yard. Upstairs there are two double bedrooms along with a generous bathroom. The front garden features a small lawn and planted borders while the rear yard is home to a block-built storage shed and gated access to the public lane to the rear. Many neighbouring properties have further extended into the rear to create more living space which could easily be done in 600 if desired. \n\nA lovely home with a picture book exterior and generous living space 600 Woodview Cottages is sure to appeal to buyers looking for a property with character and should be viewed to be fully appreciated. Viewings can be arranged with selling agent Dan Steen."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.0m x 1.15m\nWelcoming entrance hall with laminate wood flooring\n\nLounge/Bedroom 3 - 3.35m x 2.65m\nBright front-facing reception room with laminate wood flooring and attractive fireplace with open fire. Previously used as a single bedroom and ideal for that purpose if required.\n\nLiving Room - 3.35m x 2.65m\nRear-facing reception room with laminate wood flooring, wood panelling and fireplace with gas fire insert. Door to kitchen/breakfast room.\n\nKitchen Breakfast Room - 5.3m x 2.1m\nExtended kitchen/breakfast room with tile flooring, under-stair storage space, door to rear yard, fully fitted kitchen cabinets and a range of appliances.\n\nLanding - 3.0m x 1.6m\nBright landing space with carpet flooring and skylight above.\n\nBathroom - 2.8m x 2.0m\nGenerous bathroom with vinyl flooring, w.c., wash basin and corner shower.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.9m\nLarge front-facing double bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.45m x 2.8m\nRear-facing double bedroom with carpet flooring and attractive fireplace with open fire.\n\nFront Garden - 4.8m x 3.6m\nPleasant front garden space with gate and open fencing, lawn and planted borders.\n\nRear Yard - 7.75m x 4.5m\nConcrete yard with block-built storage shed and gated rear access to communal laneway. Excellent potential to further extend as has been done by neighbouring properties.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Extended three-bedroom mid-terrace cottage</li><li> Presented in great condition ready for new owners</li><li> Exceptional location right beside Rathfarnham village</li><li> Gas fired central heating & double glazing</li><li> G BER rating with A rating potential</li><li> Offered for sale with no onward chain</li><li> Ample on-street parking front & rear</li><li> Viewing highly recommended.</ul>"
      },
      {
